{"sha": "84b19326a89467b251423c849eb532bab2550c49a32612aa8cb59c76cc8b1746", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, width=8.6cm, height=5.4cm,", "    xmin=0, xmax=1.15, ymin=0, ymax=1.7,", "    xtick={0,1}, ytick=\\empty]", "  \\draw[fill=omDef!15, draw=omDef!60, thin]", "    (axis cs:0,0)      rectangle (axis cs:0.125,0.4)", "    (axis cs:0.125,0)  rectangle (axis cs:0.25,0.4156)", "    (axis cs:0.25,0)   rectangle (axis cs:0.375,0.4625)", "    (axis cs:0.375,0)  rectangle (axis cs:0.5,0.5406)", "    (axis cs:0.5,0)    rectangle (axis cs:0.625,0.65)", "    (axis cs:0.625,0)  rectangle (axis cs:0.75,0.7906)", "    (axis cs:0.75,0)   rectangle (axis cs:0.875,0.9625)", "    (axis cs:0.875,0)  rectangle (axis cs:1,1.1656);", "  \\addplot[omThm, very thick, domain=0:1.05, samples=60]", "    {0.4 + x^2};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 取 $n = 8$ 个矩形的左黎曼和：分划", "逐步加细时，一致连续性迫使阶梯形面积趋向", "$\\int_a^b f$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}\\label{ex:b1:integration:riemannexample}", "$\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{n + k} = \\frac 1n", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{1 + k/n} \\xrightarrow[n\\to\\infty]{}", "\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd x}{1 + x} = \\ln 2$：一个初等估计无法触及的极限，", "但写成黎曼和则一目了然。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[第二个黎曼和，附配凑]\\label{ex:b1:integration:riemann2}", "求 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty} \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\dfrac{n}{(n+k)^2}$。", "配凑：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{n}{(n+k)^2}", "= \\frac{1}{n}\\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{n^2}{(n+k)^2}", "= \\frac1n \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{1}{\\bigl(1 + \\frac kn\\bigr)^2} ,", "\\]", "即连续函数 $f(x) = \\frac{1}{(1+x)^2}$ 在", "$\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上的黎曼和，于是极限为", "\\[", "\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd x}{(1 + x)^2}", "= \\Bigl[-\\frac{1}{1+x}\\Bigr]_0^1 = \\frac12 .", "\\]", "小结：全部技巧在于中间一行——", "将求和项化为 $f(\\frac kn)$ 的形式，代价是", "恰好提出一个因子 $\\frac1n$；形式一旦正确，", "定理完成分析，微积分基本定理", "则完成计算。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{remark}[积分的后续应用]", "本章的每一种构造都有后续。黎曼和", "将在\\cref{ch:b1:series}中再次出现，作为级数与积分之间的桥梁", "（比较 $\\sum \\frac{1}{n^\\alpha}$ 与 $\\int", "\\frac{\\dd t}{t^\\alpha}$）；积分余项给出", "\\cref{ch:b1:taylor}中泰勒公式最精确的形式；", "基于 $\\sup$ 的定义，是本科三年级分册中勒贝格积分的原型，", "其中同样的三条性质", "（线性、单调性、收敛定理）在", "一类远为广泛的函数上重新建立。下面的周末问题", "把分部积分化为算术，即证明", "$\\pi^2$ 的无理性。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{练习}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:integration:1}", "计算：$\\displaystyle\\int_0^1 \\frac{\\dd x}{x^2 - 4}$", "\\emph{（部分分式，\\cref{ch:b1:fractions}）}；", "$\\displaystyle\\int_1^{\\eu} \\ln t \\,\\dd t$；", "$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi} t \\sin t\\, \\dd t$。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:integration:2}", "计算 $\\displaystyle\\int_0^{1} \\frac{t}{(t^2+1)^2}\\,\\dd t$", "（换元法）和", "$\\displaystyle\\int_0^{\\pi/2} \\cos^3 t\\, \\dd t$（可写成 $\\cos^3 =", "\\cos(1 - \\sin^2)$）。", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:integration:3}", "用黎曼和求下列极限：", "\\[", "u_n = \\sum_{k=1}^{n} \\frac{n}{n^2 + k^2},", "\\qquad", "v_n = \\frac{1}{n}\\sqrt[n]{\\frac{(2n)!}{n!\\,n^n}}", "\\ \\emph{(take logarithms)}.", "\\]", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:integration:4}", "设 $f$ 在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上连续。计算 $\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}", "\\int_0^1 x^n f(x)\\,\\dd x$。\\emph{（将 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 截断于 $1 -", "\\delta$ 处。）}", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:integration:5}", "（柯西–施瓦茨不等式）设 $f, g$ 在 $\\intcc{a}{b}$ 上连续，证明", "\\[", "\\Bigl(\\int_a^b fg\\Bigr)^{\\!2} \\leq \\int_a^b f^2 \\cdot \\int_a^b g^2 ,", "\\]", "将 $\\int_a^b (f + \\lambda g)^2 \\geq 0$ 展开为", "关于 $\\lambda$ 的二次式。何时等号成立？", "\\end{exercise}", "", "\\begin{exercise}[$\\star\\star$]\\label{exo:b1:integration:6}", "设 $f$ 为 $\\R$ 上的连续函数，且以 $T$ 为周期。证明 $\\int_a^{a+T}", "f$ 与 $a$ 无关，并证明 $\\frac1x \\int_0^x f(t)\\,\\dd t", "\\to \\frac 1T \\int_0^T f$，当 $x \\to +\\infty$ 时成立。", "\\end{exercise}", ""]}